// fields), two borrows of one place alias (`AliasedParts`), a local defined by
// an unwritten `Aggregate` is looked through (TK-01-local), a by-value tuple
// parameter never written is one part (`id2`), and a call result is one part
// when its source arguments pass the test against each other.
// MIR shapes: a tuple literal of borrows (plan c.5, plan.md:943, 956), a call
// with borrowed arguments (plan c.7).
